{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-42",
  "title": "Kanban Prioritization",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Kanban Prioritization"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Looking at the next steps, I think we should tackle them in this order:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Task Status Updates & Drag-and-Drop** (First Priority)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- This is the core functionality of a Kanban board"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Will require vue-draggable-next"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Need to handle both drag-drop and manual status changes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Will establish the event handling pattern for task updates"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Add/Edit/Delete Task Modals** (Second Priority)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- These modals will be needed for all task operations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Will define the task mutation patterns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Can reuse these components across other views (grid, list, table)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Column Customization** (Third Priority)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Allow adding/editing columns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Custom statuses"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Column reordering"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Depends on having solid task update functionality"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Task Filtering & Sorting** (Fourth Priority)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Enhanced filtering within columns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Sort by different criteria"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Builds on top of existing task management"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Loading States & Animations** (Final Polish)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Smooth transitions for all operations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Loading skeletons"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Error states"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Best implemented after core functionality is solid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I suggest we start with implementing drag-and-drop using vue-draggable-next, as it's the foundation of a Kanban board. Would you like me to proceed with that implementation?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The drag-and-drop implementation will include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Installing and setting up vue-draggable-next"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Implementing drag between columns"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Handling status updates when tasks are moved"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Adding visual feedback during drag operations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Setting up the proper event handlers for task updates"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How does this plan sound to you?"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}